00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:17.677
Yes, yes.
- Yeah, like that?

00:07:17.677 --> 00:07:18.730
And then what?
- No, no.

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:20.040
'Cause you're gonna kill his body.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:20.990
You have to twist this way.

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.160
- I don't wanna kill his body.
- Into here.

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:23.104
- Okay, okay.
- And then do that.

00:07:23.104 --> 00:07:24.640
- And then you twist this?
- And that's the last one.

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:27.060
- Okay.
(balloon squeaking)

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:28.740
- Yes, yes, you're doing it!

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:29.943
- Okay, okay.

00:07:29.943 --> 00:07:31.736
- Wait, well...
- What?

00:07:31.736 --> 00:07:32.572
- Oh yeah, that's great!

00:07:32.572 --> 00:07:33.422
(audience applauding and laughing)

00:07:33.422 --> 00:07:34.255
Look!

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:37.723
- Yes!

00:07:39.409 --> 00:07:40.742
- Yes, yes, yes!

00:07:42.251 --> 00:07:45.378
To everyone who said she
couldn't do it, she did it!

00:07:45.378 --> 00:07:46.211
- Suck it!

00:07:47.573 --> 00:07:49.060
Thank you!
- You're welcome.

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:50.050
I'm a great hype man.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:52.580
- That's actually terrifying,
'cause I keep feeling

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:53.413
