00:07:53.413 --> 00:07:54.847
I've had a lot of balloons,
I throw a lot of parties

00:07:54.847 --> 00:07:56.720
for my kids and they
always pop in my face.

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:58.290
You know I'm very proud of this number

00:07:58.290 --> 00:07:59.720
so it's staying right there.
- I'm glad, I'm glad.

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:01.353
- Yep, worked hard for that.

